#: templates/admin/core/biography/csv_import.html:37
msgid ""
"Match biographies are identified by the 'full_name_ar' column (required). "
"Empty cells are ignored and never overwrite existing data."
msgstr ""
"يتم تحديد التراجم المطابِقة عبر عمود 'full_name_ar' (إلزامي). تُتجاهَل الخلايا "
